# Example cron fragment for M40 daily pipeline (M42 ops pack).
# Default: replay; non-trading days exit 0 via TradingCalendar.
# Adjust REPO path; do not put secrets here.
#
# Install:
#   crontab -e
#   # paste one of the lines below after editing paths
#
# Recommended: call the PowerShell wrapper (handles skip itself).
# Every day 08:30 local — wrapper skips CN weekends / closed weekdays:

# 30 8 * * * cd /path/to/stock-platform && pwsh -NoProfile -File ./scripts/ops/Invoke-DailyPipeline.ps1 -SkipRefresh

# Weekdays-only trigger (still need calendar for public holidays):

# 30 8 * * 1-5 cd /path/to/stock-platform && pwsh -NoProfile -File ./scripts/ops/Invoke-DailyPipeline.ps1 -SkipRefresh
